### Voucher

```text
DRAFT
SUBMITTED
APPROVED
POSTED
REVERSED
CANCELLED
```

### Purchase Order

```text
DRAFT
SUBMITTED
APPROVED
PARTIALLY_RECEIVED
FULLY_RECEIVED
CLOSED
CANCELLED
```

