# ১১. ERP Domain Analysis: এই Software কীভাবে কাজ করবে

SLBL-ERP একটি project-centric real-estate developer এবং construction company ERP। এটি শুধু data-entry বা CRUD application নয়। এর মূল business cycle হলো:

```text
Investor / Capital
  → Project এবং Unit তৈরি
  → Client Sales / Booking
  → Demand এবং Installment
  → Collection এবং Receivable
  → Procurement / Contractor / Construction Cost
  → Payable এবং Cash Disbursement
  → Payroll / Investor Payout / Tax
  → Accounting Ledger
  → Financial এবং Operational Reports
```

Accounting & Finance হবে পুরো software-এর financial source of truth। অন্য module-গুলো operational document তৈরি করবে; approved financial event হলে Accounting সেই event-এর double-entry তৈরি করবে। কোনো module নিজে balance, paid amount বা ledger balance ইচ্ছামতো update করবে না।

## Module Ownership এবং Accounting Relation

| Module | Operational responsibility | Financial event |
|---|---|---|
| Projects | Project, tower, unit, milestone | WIP/cost center reference |
| Clients & Sales | Client, booking, agreement, demand | Sales receivable, revenue/deposit |
| Collections | Installment collection, overdue follow-up | Cash/Bank বনাম receivable |
| Procurement | Vendor, requisition, PO, GRN, vendor bill | Inventory/WIP/expense বনাম payable |
| Construction | MRN, work order, RA bill, labour, fuel | Project WIP, contractor payable, cash |
| HR | Employee, attendance, leave, payroll | Salary expense এবং payroll payable |
| Investors | Equity, contribution, payout | Equity/investor payable এবং cash |
| Accounting | COA, vouchers, ledger, reconciliation | Final financial truth |
| Reports | Financial/operational read model | Ledger এবং approved operational data |
| Settings | Company, fiscal year, tax, approval rules | Global accounting configuration |

