# ১২. Accounting Control Model

## Accounting-এর পাঁচটি স্তর

```text
1. Master Data
   Chart of Accounts, tax, fiscal year, cost center, bank/cash accounts

2. Source Documents
   Booking, invoice, bill, GRN, RA bill, payroll, investor payout

3. Approval
   Department approval এবং Finance approval

4. Posting
   Approved document থেকে immutable journal/ledger entry

5. Control এবং Reporting
   Reconciliation, period close, trial balance, P&L, balance sheet, cash flow
```

## Document এবং Ledger-এর সম্পর্ক

প্রতিটি source document-এ এই field থাকতে হবে:

```text
sourceType
sourceId
documentNo
documentDate
companyId
projectId / costCenterId
currency
taxAmount
netAmount
grossAmount
status
createdBy
approvedBy
postedAt
```

Ledger entry-তে source document-এর reference বাধ্যতামূলক হবে। Post হওয়ার পরে voucher বা ledger line edit করা যাবে না; correction হলে reversal এবং নতুন correcting voucher হবে।

## Double-entry Rule

প্রতিটি journal-এ এক বা একাধিক debit line এবং credit line থাকবে।

```text
SUM(debit lines) = SUM(credit lines)
```

প্রধান posting rules:

| Business event | Debit | Credit |
|---|---|---|
| Client invoice/demand | Accounts Receivable | Booking/Sales Revenue বা Customer Advance |
| Client collection | Cash/Bank | Accounts Receivable |
| Vendor bill | Project WIP/Expense/Inventory | Accounts Payable |
| Vendor payment | Accounts Payable | Cash/Bank |
| Payroll approval | Salary Expense | Salary Payable |
| Salary payment | Salary Payable | Cash/Bank |
| Investor contribution | Cash/Bank | Investor Equity/Payable |
| Investor payout | Investor Payable/Equity | Cash/Bank |
| Bank charge | Bank Charge Expense | Bank |
| Fund transfer | Destination Cash/Bank | Source Cash/Bank |
| Depreciation | Depreciation Expense | Accumulated Depreciation |

Revenue recognition, customer advance, WIP capitalization, retention, VAT এবং withholding tax company policy অনুযায়ী configurable হবে; UI label দেখে সরাসরি revenue post করা যাবে না।

