# ১৬. Exact Implementation Workflow: একবারে একটি Vertical Slice

প্রতিটি phase-এ একই delivery loop ব্যবহার করতে হবে:

```text
1. UI action inventory
2. Domain entity এবং status definition
3. Database migration এবং constraints
4. DTO এবং validation
5. Repository/query
6. Service use case
7. Permission/policy
8. Transaction এবং accounting event
9. Controller route এবং Swagger
10. Unit/integration/E2E test
11. Frontend API integration
12. Mock data removal
13. UI state এবং accessibility verification
```

## Vertical Slice 1: Booking থেকে Collection পর্যন্ত

```text
Project
  → Unit
  → Client
  → Booking draft
  → Booking approval/confirmation
  → Invoice/demand
  → Installment schedule
  → Payment collection
  → Money receipt
  → AR journal
  → Cash/Bank balance
  → Client ledger এবং report
```

এটি সম্পূর্ণ না হওয়া পর্যন্ত Procurement বা Payroll-এর deep automation শুরু করা উচিত নয়, কারণ এই slice-এ core ERP pattern, ID/reference, approval, posting, receipt, audit এবং report সব পরীক্ষা হয়।

## Vertical Slice 2: Procurement থেকে Vendor Payment

```text
MRN/Purchase Requisition
  → PO
  → Approval
  → GRN
  → Vendor Bill
  → Three-way match (PO + GRN + Bill)
  → AP journal
  → Vendor payment
  → Bank reconciliation
```

## Vertical Slice 3: Construction RA Bill থেকে Project Cost

```text
Work Order
  → Progress measurement
  → RA Bill
  → Site verification
  → Project approval
  → Retention/tax calculation
  → Finance approval
  → Project WIP/AP journal
  → Contractor payment
```

## Vertical Slice 4: Payroll এবং Investor Payout

```text
Attendance/Payroll run → Approval → Salary payable → Payment → Ledger
Investor contribution → Equity register → Payout approval → Payment → Ledger
```

## Vertical Slice 5: Month-end Control

```text
AR aging
  + AP aging
  + Bank reconciliation
  + Payroll payable
  + Project WIP
  + Tax/VAT
  → Trial balance
  → P&L / Balance Sheet / Cash Flow
  → Period close
```

