# ১৭. Backend Function Boundary

Business-critical function-এর নাম এবং দায়িত্ব আগে স্থির করতে হবে:

```text
AccountingService.createDraftVoucher()
AccountingService.submitVoucher()
AccountingService.approveVoucher()
AccountingService.postVoucher()
AccountingService.reverseVoucher()
AccountingService.getLedger()
AccountingService.getTrialBalance()

PostingService.postClientInvoice()
PostingService.postClientCollection()
PostingService.postVendorBill()
PostingService.postVendorPayment()
PostingService.postPayroll()
PostingService.postInvestorPayout()

ReceivableService.createInstallmentSchedule()
ReceivableService.recordCollection()
ReceivableService.calculateAging()

PayableService.matchPurchaseBill()
PayableService.createPaymentRequest()
PayableService.calculateRetentionAndTax()

